    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property Overview<br><br>Beach Song is a newly remodeled, pet-friendly vacation home located in the heart of Blue Mountain Beach along 30A. Designed for comfort and connection, this coastal retreat pairs modern updates with a relaxed beach atmosphere that makes it easy to settle in and stay awhile.<br><br>The home features three bedrooms, two and a half bathrooms, and sleeping accommodations for up to ten guests. The open living and dining area flows into a fully equipped kitchen with brand new stainless steel appliances, while TVs in every bedroom add comfort and convenience. A spacious outdoor deck provides the perfect place to gather, unwind, and enjoy the coastal breeze.<br><br>Sleeping Accommodations<br><br>Primary bedroom: King bed<br>Second bedroom: Queen bed<br>Additional sleeping includes one full bed, two twin beds, and one queen sleeper sofa<br><br>Interior Features<br><br>Recently remodeled interior<br>Fully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances<br>Granite countertops<br>Hardwood floors<br>Open-concept living and dining space<br>Washer and dryer<br>Central air conditioning and ceiling fans<br><br>Outdoor and Community Amenities<br><br>Large outdoor deck with seating and dining area<br>Community pool access<br>Four bikes included<br>Gas grill<br>Nearby public beach access<br><br>Location and Area<br><br>Located in the heart of Blue Mountain Beach, this home offers easy access to the beach, 30A bike paths, local dining, and nearby coastal communities.<br><br>Important Information<br><br>Pet friendly with approval<br>Maximum occupancy of ten guests<br>Primary renter must be at least 25 years of age<br>No parties or events<br>Starter household supplies provided for arrival",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
